select public.admin_notify('🩺 D60: App LIVE + secret se server-side jaanch — app deactivated NAHI hai', 'Owner ne app publish (Live) kar diya, Privacy Policy URL + Category Games/Action bhare, Required actions khaali — phir bhi wahi "App not active". Owner ne App Secret Drive private file (Instagram agent connect/App secret/Instagram connect app secret.txt) me daala — bilkul sahi jagah. Agent ne secret se live Graph probes kiye: (1) client_credentials se app-level token bana — debug_token: is_valid=true ⇒ app Meta servers par active hai, deactivated NAHI; (2) app object: Mini eSports, category Games/Action, live; (3) bina session ke dialog probe business.facebook.com/dialog/oauth/account_switch tak pahunchta hai (session ke bina generic error normal). Matlab "App not active" koi app-level ban nahi — dialog/session/config level ki dikkat hai. Agle kadam owner ko: (a) configuration se NAYA Login URL generate karke try karo (purana URL publish-se-pehle ka state rakhta ho sakta hai); (b) incognito me developer FB account se login karke try karo; (c) fir bhi wahi error to error ka screenshot + Login URL chat me paste karo (config_id secret NAHI hai — Meta docs/Postiz PR confirm) taki agent parameters server-side verify kare; (d) zaroorat ho to nayi SUAT configuration banakar uska Login URL use karo. Tokens aane par usi Drive folder me file me lines add karni hain → "codes file ready".', 'session_end') as notified;
